        ],
        "implementation": {
          "summary": "Subscribe to the simulated Drone pose and verify receipt.",
          "notes": "Planned test probe. Subscribe to /pdu/Drone/pos as geometry_msgs/msg/Twist and compare with Drone/pos. The Twist encodes pose and Euler attitude."
